{'symbol': 'VFC', 'date': '2021-06-21 10:00:00', 'title': 'VANS SPOTLIGHTS THE POWER OF SKATEBOARDING IN PARTNERSHIP WITH TONY HAWK, SKATEISTAN AND VANS ATHLETES IN NEW COMMUNITY-FOCUSED CAMPAIGN', 'text': 'COSTA MESA, CALIF., JUNE 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IN CELEBRATION OF GO SKATEBOARDING DAY,\xa0 VANS, THE GLOBAL LEADER IN SKATEBOARDING FOR OVER 50 YEARS,\xa0PROUDLY ANNOUNCES A NEW PARTNERSHIP WITH\xa0 SKATEISTAN , THE AWARD-WINNING INTERNATIONAL NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION WHICH EMPOWERS YOUTH THROUGH SKATEBOARDING AND EDUCATION IN AFGHANISTAN, CAMBODIA, SOUTH AFRICA AND SUPPORTS OTHER SOCIAL SKATE PROJECTS AROUND THE WORLD.'}